  "notes": [
    "The universe remains degenerate in the ways integration round 2 recorded, and w107 closes none of them. Two measured findings worth reading beside this gate. First, the v1 rectangle cannot make food: of the 59 authored resource-yield effects at target universe, exactly five sit in a v1 cell and all five route to stone, because terram is the only material-bearing form among the twelve. Every ruleset comparison taken inside the v1 rectangle is therefore an argument about stone. Second, stated carefully because the sloppy version has misled several readers: advanceConstruction and applyLibraryUpkeep both have production callers in world-step.ts and run every tick, so construction is NOT inert. What is measured over 1200 ticks of the reference universe with zero god actions is constructionStoneOwed 0, buildProgressAdded 0, universitiesCompleted 0, against exactly one university -- the seeded academy, already complete. Founding a site is a god action, so with no actions submitted there is nothing to advance and stone is never spent. Those two facts together are why the campaign-plan W90 measurement of a yield-maximising ruleset was null by construction of its arms rather than for want of a mechanism: the arms could only make stone, and stone had nothing to buy.",
    "Measured 2026-08-14 on w70/opening-square merged with origin/main at 769452845f31c33ab7800d3333fcb5c818feef41. NO GOLDEN FIXTURE WAS REGENERATED, and none needed to be: what moved is the stream registry hash, not a replay. ui/session.json is byte-identical after npm run ui:record -- snapshotHash did not move. balance-gate-ascension-v1 was deliberately NOT re-recorded: it carries the same superseded rngRegistryHash and will refuse for the same reason, but its Actions job is already failing on main at that ref and is marked not required to merge, so re-recording it is a separate decision on a separate failure.",
    "Re-recorded 2026-08-14 on w109/alliances merged with origin/main at 8d2159f. The earlier re-record on this branch was provenance-only against merge base 7694528; this one is provenance-only against main's CURRENT baselines, which is the stronger statement and the one docs/design/baseline-decisions-2026-08-14.md asked for. 109 of 109 metric rows across the three gates reported delta 0.00000 before regeneration. The agency gate is included deliberately and against an earlier instruction to leave it alone: that instruction's reason was that main's agency copy was 17 rows stale, and it is not stale any more -- PR #72 landed as 672066f and absorbed those rows, so all 90 agency rows now reproduce exactly and this regeneration imports none of main's numbers, only the contentHash stamp. ui/session.json is byte-identical after npm run ui:record on the merged tree -- snapshotHash c1ce1ddac50f97e6 and actionSpaceSize 17 are this branch's own and did not move in the merge."
  ],
