  "rationale": "Provenance only, and NOTHING MOVED, re-verified against main's own committed baselines after merging origin/main at 8d2159f. The seventeenth god-cost record -- action 16, inviteScholar -- moves provenance.contentHash from d4e3047657b4fa8a1a74e1d52f9f5c86 to b63bd615c1877925b36c7b3eb7812731, and gate.ts treats that key as a block-level refusal before it reads a metric, so this file had to be re-recorded whether or not any number moved. NO NUMBER MOVED. Measured on the merged tree before regenerating: balance-gate-v1 9 of 9 rows at delta 0.00000, balance-gate-horizon-v1 10 of 10 at delta 0.00000, balance-gate-agency-v1 90 of 90 at delta 0.00000 -- 109 of 109 against main's baselines at 8d2159f, with baseline-invalid on contentHash the only finding in any of the three. This confirms the prediction docs/design/baseline-decisions-2026-08-14.md made for this branch: if no gate strategy exercises action 16, a re-run on the rebased tree reproduces main's values exactly and the regeneration is again provenance-only. It does. Three independent checks say why: auditPool on this tree, with action 16 forced into every audited set and each run checked against an untouched one by snapshotHash, reports action 16 legal on 0 of 60 and 0 of 240 ticks for all fourteen pool strategies including uniform-random-legal, the only gate strategy that samples the legal set; it first becomes legal at world tick 276 under passive play, past both gate horizons. Forcing invitableSpecies empty reproduces the agency gate byte for byte across all 90 comparisons. And main added NO content data between this branch's merge base 7694528 and 8d2159f, so b63bd615 is the same hash this branch measured before the merge. provenance.rngRegistryHash is 2bc5d131f2a7423ce439ee6ca933d74316f48eac1d214b23259aa4559b18c2c9 on both sides, unchanged by this branch -- the openingSquare stream is main's, from PR #72. NO RNG STREAM was added here, NO WORLD SCHEMA REVISION was needed, NO GOLDEN FIXTURE WAS REGENERATED, and balance-gate-ascension-v1 is deliberately untouched. THIS FILE IS A MEASUREMENT, NOT A BALANCE CLAIM: release-plan.md forbids a balance claim before 0.5.0 and nothing here is one. The universe remains degenerate in the ways the first note records.",
